codex
The source evidence supports keeping sigmoid in full attention. SGLang reads `output_gate_type` for Gated DeltaNet’s output normalization, while its full-attention path still uses sigmoid. Installed Transformers and the downloaded reference also agree on the full-attention calculation. I’m checking those findings against pinned revisions for the report.
